  "goodToKnow": "Die Tagung is a conference or formal meeting, often of an association or in academia: die Jahrestagung (annual conference), eine Tagung besuchen. The verb is tagen (to meet, to sit): Der Ausschuss tagt heute. Tagen can also mean to dawn (es tagt), but that's old and poetic. An informal word for a meeting is das Treffen."
